<para>Log-density of the Multivariate Normal distribution.</para><para>Evaluate the log-density of <computeroutput>N</computeroutput> observations of a <computeroutput>q</computeroutput> dimensional Multivariate Normal distribution. Each argument can be vectorized, meaning that it can have length either <computeroutput>N</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>1</computeroutput>, denoted here as <computeroutput>n</computeroutput>.</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">X</parametername>
